{"id":"n73222-1-8","stage":4,"title":"형부 · 姐夫","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73222-1-8-1","ko":"언니, 표정이 왜 그렇게 안 좋아? 무슨 일 있어?","zh":"姐姐，你怎么脸色不好？发生什么了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언니,","meaning":"姐姐，大姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐，大姐","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"3","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"표정이","meaning":"表情，脸色","explanation":"표정：表情，脸色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"표정","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72390","senseId":"1","lemma":"표정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아?","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐，大姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"fb140081bcc182e5","term":"표정","zh":"表情，脸色","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3","entryId":"72390","definition":"心中的情感或想法等表露在脸上；或指那样的模样。","pronunciation":["표정"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ca9e9c6b5c714001f489.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73222-1-8-2","ko":"네 형부랑 말다툼을 조금 했어.","zh":"和你姐夫拌了几句嘴。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"네：“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84427","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"형부랑","meaning":"姐夫","explanation":"형부：姐夫；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"형부","audio":"/audio/48328ba7d203f729286b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73222","senseId":"1","lemma":"형부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말다툼을","meaning":"吵架，吵嘴","explanation":"말다툼：吵架，吵嘴；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말다툼","audio":"/audio/29e49d135f613ce4675e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51702","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다툼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"做出，作出","explanation":"하다：做出，作出；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"3","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"84427","definition":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"48328ba7d203f729","term":"형부","zh":"姐夫","audio":"/audio/48328ba7d203f729286b.mp3","entryId":"73222","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼姐姐的丈夫。","pronunciation":["형부"]},{"id":"29e49d135f613ce4","term":"말다툼","zh":"吵架，吵嘴","audio":"/audio/29e49d135f613ce4675e.mp3","entryId":"51702","definition":"为争辩对错而用言语争吵的行为。","pronunciation":["말ː다툼"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做出，作出","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"露出某种表情或表现出某种态度等。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d759d11046cb4d10de99.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.854,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73222","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":133,"sequenceScore":2.5793,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["和你姐夫拌了几句嘴。","姐姐，你怎么脸色不好？发生什么了？","看你的裤子变宽松了，应该是瘦了吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["姐姐，你怎么脸色不好？发生什么了？","看你的裤子变宽松了，应该是瘦了吧。","和你姐夫拌了几句嘴。"],"answer":2}]}
